    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12457" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποδημ-ητικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fond of wandering</i> or <i>travelling,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dicaearch.
				1.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				98.7
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παράστασις ἀ.</span> banishment
