				<u>Pol.</u>
				1308b19
			</span></i>: metaph., <i>migratory,</i> i.e. <i>mortal,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Epict.</u>
				3.24.4
			</span></i>, cf. ib.<i><span class="en">
				60
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				105
			</span></i>.</div>
